# Pairs with TypeOK. The type invariant rejects a chain stage outside the link protocol.
MODULE: UnknownChainStage
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the capture starts the link in a stage the chain does not have
PERTURBS: BeginCapture

--- FIND
    /\ leafTurn' = "capture"
    /\ chain' = "root"
--- REPLACE
    /\ leafTurn' = "capture"
    \* MUTATION: an unknown chain stage
    /\ chain' = "rooted"
--- END
